{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>The nakedness of your father.</b> And he began with the father, for he precedes the son. And he said that forbidden is everyone who is the nakedness of father and mother. Now she — the mother — is first, then the nakedness of a father's wife who is not a mother, then the sister who is his father's daughter or his mother's daughter."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:38.231044996Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}